o seven:Simplified Chinese — 简体中文Japanese — 日本語Brazilian Portuguese — Português (Brasil)German — DeutschRussian — РусскийFrench — Français English remains available, too. These language options are included in both the demo and the full-game build. Choose your languageOpen Settings → Language from the main menu or pause menu. You can switch without restarting, and your choice is saved for ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T20:00:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040561","verified_at":"2026-10-24T23:30:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4873550-1846651706687800","game_id":"steam-4873550","kind":"announcement","title":"BudMageddon 1.5.1 — New Art & Shop Themes","summary":"Hey growers!I’ve been giving BudMageddon a fresh look. Here’s what’s changed in 1.5.1.Updated sector artNew backgrounds, station art, and plant animations across several sectors. Take a quick look! Later sectors shown here are from the full game. The demo covers the opening section.New shop themesPrestige shops now have different sector themes and illustrated upgrade cards. Levels and seed prices are easier to read, too. MercurySaturnNeptune Other improvementsBetter plant sizing and spacing.Fixe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T19:10:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687800","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4873550-1846018067938439","game_id":"steam-4873550","kind":"announcement","title":"BudMageddon is joining Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey growers!BudMageddon is joining Steam Next Fest, October 19–26, and you can get started right now with the free demo!The aliens want weed—and Earth is counting on you to deliver. Start growing, keep your production moving, and turn a small operation into a cosmic growing empire.Grow. Upgrade. Automate.Watch your plants grow, harvest your crops, and put your earnings into better production. Build toward an operation that keeps working while you plan your next upgrade.Help shape BudMageddonGive","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T13:01:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938439","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4873550-1844115010499906","game_id":"steam-4873550","kind":"announcement","title":"The aliens set a deadline: BudMageddon launches November 3","summary":"date headline → what's in the full game (conversion economy, automation, prestige, 15 sectors, 34 achievements, a real ending) → play the demo → wishlist.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T22:07:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499906","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4873550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:33Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4873550":"2026-10-26T14:53:34Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4873550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:33Z"},"4928950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:34Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4873550","app_id":4873550,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026